  "plain": "AARO, the Pentagon office set up in 2022 to look into unexplained objects in the sky, has a Latin motto that translates roughly as \"the universe is what our thoughts make of it.\" A Pentagon whistleblower named Matthew Brown points this out to Michels, saying he may not have the translation exactly right. He finds it a telling choice of words for an office meant to study these things."
